{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Audio Evaluation \u2014 WER, MOS, UTMOS, MMAU, FAD, and the Open Leaderboards Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: WER with normalization"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from jiwer import wer, Compose, ToLowerCase, RemovePunctuation, Strip"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "transform = Compose([ToLowerCase(), RemovePunctuation(), Strip()])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "score = wer("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    truth=\"Please turn on the lights.\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    hypothesis=\"please turn on the light\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    truth_transform=transform,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    hypothesis_transform=transform,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# ~0.17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: TTS round-trip WER"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def ttr_wer(tts_model, asr_model, texts):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    errors = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for txt in texts:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        audio = tts_model.synthesize(txt)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        recog = asr_model.transcribe(audio)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        errors.append(wer(truth=txt, hypothesis=recog))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return sum(errors) / len(errors)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: SECS for voice cloning"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from speechbrain.inference.speaker import EncoderClassifier"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "sv = EncoderClassifier.from_hparams(\"speechbrain/spkrec-ecapa-voxceleb\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "emb_ref = sv.encode_batch(load_wav(\"reference.wav\"))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "emb_clone = sv.encode_batch(load_wav(\"cloned.wav\"))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "secs = torch.nn.functional.cosine_similarity(emb_ref, emb_clone, dim=-1).item()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: FAD for music generation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from frechet_audio_distance import FrechetAudioDistance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "fad = FrechetAudioDistance()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "score = fad.get_fad_score(\"generated_folder/\", \"reference_folder/\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 5: EER for speaker verification (same code as Lesson 6)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def eer(same_scores, diff_scores):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    thresholds = sorted(set(same_scores + diff_scores))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    best = (1.0, 0.0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for t in thresholds:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        far = sum(1 for s in diff_scores if s >= t) / len(diff_scores)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        frr = sum(1 for s in same_scores if s < t) / len(same_scores)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if abs(far - frr) < best[0]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            best = (abs(far - frr), (far + frr) / 2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return best[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
